WEBVTT

﻿1
00:01:27.963 --> 00:01:29.298
I'll bring you the menu.

2
00:01:30.382 --> 00:01:32.802
Oh, thank you.

3
00:01:36.722 --> 00:01:38.432
- Well done everyone!
- thank you!

4
00:01:38.516 --> 00:01:39.683
- thank you!
- thank you!

5
00:01:39.767 --> 00:01:41.519
Well done today. See you next week!

6
00:01:46.774 --> 00:01:47.608
Do you think they met?

7
00:01:48.567 --> 00:01:50.986
My sister was the one who went on the blind date.
But I'm excited myself

8
00:01:51.570 --> 00:01:54.198
May it be successful, don't you think? Brother-in-law's younger brother.

9
00:01:54.281 --> 00:01:55.449
Yea

10
00:01:56.450 --> 00:01:57.326
But...

11
00:01:57.409 --> 00:01:59.620
Is your older sister strong and mentally tough?

12
00:01:59.703 --> 00:02:01.580
War between Ukraine and Russia

13
00:02:01.664 --> 00:02:03.123
and the Israeli-Palestinian conflict.

14
00:02:03.207 --> 00:02:04.625
The scariest thing about all of this.

15
00:02:04.708 --> 00:02:07.086
is a part of the world
Become a person who is indifferent to the war.

16
00:02:07.169 --> 00:02:09.588
No one realizes that the world order
that was once manageable

17
00:02:09.672 --> 00:02:11.340
It's collapsing right now.

18
00:02:11.423 --> 00:02:12.633
This is the reason that at one point

19
00:02:12.716 --> 00:02:14.885
People say that World War III could break out.

20
00:02:14.969 --> 00:02:15.803
I'm sorry.

21
00:02:16.303 --> 00:02:18.138
I heard that you used to be a flight attendant.

22
00:02:18.222 --> 00:02:21.350
I don't think you'll be interested.
Regarding international relations of this size

23
00:02:21.433 --> 00:02:22.643
Is it an air hostess?

24
00:02:24.478 --> 00:02:25.729
Is it a flight attendant?

25
00:02:28.399 --> 00:02:30.901
Excuse me. Aren't you a police detective?

26
00:02:30.985 --> 00:02:32.278
A spy? It's me.

27
00:02:33.153 --> 00:02:35.656
I am a C8 civil servant.
I work at the city hall.

28
00:02:36.574 --> 00:02:39.118
Aren't you a flight attendant for Asia Airlines?

29
00:02:39.201 --> 00:02:40.369
It's me.

30
00:02:57.094 --> 00:02:58.345
Incredible

31
00:02:58.429 --> 00:03:01.473
This woman really doesn't know the time.

32
00:03:01.557 --> 00:03:04.727
Seriously, which reporter didn't arrive on time?

33
00:03:04.810 --> 00:03:06.896
How can I do my own work like this?

34
00:03:06.979 --> 00:03:09.690
First impressions are the lifeblood of a blind date.

35
00:03:09.773 --> 00:03:11.942
What time is it?

36
00:03:12.026 --> 00:03:14.111
It's obvious why she's still single.

37
00:03:14.862 --> 00:03:17.656
The little fucker wouldn't tell me her name or phone number.

38
00:03:17.740 --> 00:03:18.699
What next?

39
00:03:18.782 --> 00:03:20.701
If she doesn't come, should we go back?

40
00:03:22.244 --> 00:03:23.245
Crazy!

41
00:03:24.538 --> 00:03:27.249
Please tell the guy who came on a blind date.
that I was late because of traffic jams

42
00:03:27.333 --> 00:03:29.585
- Haven't met each other yet?
- You should have given me his number!

43
00:03:29.668 --> 00:03:32.421
I entered the wrong room and talked to no one!

44
00:03:32.504 --> 00:03:33.464
That's all!

45
00:03:34.006 --> 00:03:35.257
Damn, this kid doesn't have any problems.

46
00:03:37.384 --> 00:03:38.344
Today started off not pretty.

47
00:03:39.803 --> 00:03:41.805
What happened? Haven't they met yet?

48
00:03:41.889 --> 00:03:43.933
Sunwoo, you called your brother.

49
00:03:44.016 --> 00:03:46.477
And can you please tell him that my sister is stuck in traffic?
and will be 30 minutes late

50
00:03:46.560 --> 00:03:47.394
Sure.

51
00:03:50.773 --> 00:03:53.150
What do you mean?
When I said that my sister might have been surprised.

52
00:03:53.943 --> 00:03:54.985
Oh, that is…

53
00:03:56.487 --> 00:03:58.322
There's something about my hyung that I haven't told you.

54
00:03:58.405 --> 00:03:59.573
What is it?

55
00:04:00.741 --> 00:04:03.994
Wow, that's a really classic excuse!

56
00:04:04.078 --> 00:04:07.456
Seriously, is there a traffic jam?

57
00:04:08.624 --> 00:04:10.501
"Traffic jam"?

58
00:04:10.584 --> 00:04:12.211
I'm going crazy.

59
00:04:17.967 --> 00:04:18.884
Yes.

60
00:04:54.294 --> 00:04:55.713
Why are you here?

61
00:04:56.630 --> 00:04:58.257
Did I enter the wrong room again?

62
00:05:01.343 --> 00:05:03.387
He looks like my Pil-gu hyung. It's Im Hyun Jun.

63
00:05:03.470 --> 00:05:04.388
Im Hyun Jun

64
00:05:04.471 --> 00:05:08.308
Im Hyun Jun

65
00:05:10.310 --> 00:05:11.145
Hello

66
00:05:13.188 --> 00:05:14.023
Don't you know me?

67
00:05:16.817 --> 00:05:18.027
You are…

68
00:05:20.863 --> 00:05:23.532
You look familiar, but...

69
00:05:25.409 --> 00:05:26.910
Do I know you?

70
00:05:29.955 --> 00:05:33.500
She graduated from Hankuk University and is a journalist.

71
00:05:39.798 --> 00:05:40.758
What?

72
00:05:42.301 --> 00:05:43.135
Are you okay?

73
00:05:44.136 --> 00:05:45.179
You said...

74
00:05:45.846 --> 00:05:47.931
Your older brother is Im Hyun Jun.

75
00:05:48.015 --> 00:05:50.934
And the guy who's going on a blind date with my sister right now.

76
00:05:51.018 --> 00:05:52.019
Is that Kang Pilgu?

77
00:05:52.102 --> 00:05:53.270
The good detective Kang Pil Goo?

78
00:05:53.353 --> 00:05:55.981
I really wasn't lying.
When I told you he was a spy

79
00:06:02.279 --> 00:06:03.113
Ah, that's bad.

80
00:06:04.448 --> 00:06:05.491
Why?

81
00:06:05.574 --> 00:06:06.450
Damn it.

82
00:06:07.618 --> 00:06:10.454
Our world is very round.

83
00:06:10.537 --> 00:06:11.622
I agree.

84
00:06:20.089 --> 00:06:20.964
Do you want to order food?

85
00:06:21.048 --> 00:06:22.174
Yes.

86
00:06:22.257 --> 00:06:25.135
- Anyway, it's time to eat...
- I'd like an iced Americano, please.

87
00:06:25.219 --> 00:06:26.678
I want the same.

88
00:06:26.762 --> 00:06:28.055
Yes.

89
00:06:29.431 --> 00:06:30.641
When it's like this

90
00:06:30.724 --> 00:06:33.227
I think you probably don't have the mood to eat anything.

91
00:06:33.310 --> 00:06:35.813
Yes, I am amazed at how quickly you realized this.

92
00:06:37.064 --> 00:06:38.941
I have a friend who is studying medicine.

93
00:06:39.024 --> 00:06:40.484
His brother is a police detective.

94
00:06:40.567 --> 00:06:42.111
I heard that you are a spy.

95
00:06:42.194 --> 00:06:43.695
Kang Pilgun is a spy.

96
00:06:43.779 --> 00:06:44.988
He is my other self.

97
00:06:46.448 --> 00:06:48.450
Will you write news about this as well?

98
00:06:48.534 --> 00:06:50.369
"Blind date with actor Im Hyun Joon"

99
00:06:50.452 --> 00:06:53.205
I'm not low enough to write something like that.

100
00:06:53.831 --> 00:06:54.915
How much do I disagree?

101
00:06:55.499 --> 00:06:58.836
You even went so far as to check out my social media.

102
00:06:58.919 --> 00:07:00.379
And I dug out who I had an affair with three years ago.

103
00:07:00.462 --> 00:07:02.256
I think that's low.

104
00:07:05.092 --> 00:07:05.926
That is...

105
00:07:06.426 --> 00:07:08.220
At that time, I was dizzy from revenge.

106
00:07:09.513 --> 00:07:11.431
Thank you for accepting it.

107
00:07:12.349 --> 00:07:13.183
But...

108
00:07:13.267 --> 00:07:15.936
So your brother and my brother are friends, right?

109
00:07:16.019 --> 00:07:17.521
Is your younger sister a medical student?

110
00:07:17.604 --> 00:07:20.190
No, he majored in film and drama.

111
00:07:22.234 --> 00:07:23.735
Movies and dramas?

112
00:07:24.570 --> 00:07:26.613
If he knew that we knew each other at acting school…

113
00:07:26.697 --> 00:07:28.240
My Pilgu hyung is definitely fainting.

114
00:07:28.323 --> 00:07:29.741
Fate was too funny.

115
00:07:32.035 --> 00:07:34.830
My younger brother is majoring in film and drama.
Where is it wrong?

116
00:07:36.039 --> 00:07:37.040
It's not wrong.

117
00:07:37.958 --> 00:07:41.253
But it's wrong for my younger sister to hang out with your younger sister.

118
00:07:41.336 --> 00:07:43.172
You look mad at your med student brother.

119
00:07:43.255 --> 00:07:44.548
Best friends with my younger sibling who floats around every day.

120
00:07:44.631 --> 00:07:46.717
You seem protective of your younger sibling because your younger sibling isn't that smart.

121
00:07:46.800 --> 00:07:48.218
But I don't mean it like that.

122
00:07:50.971 --> 00:07:53.182
No matter what, it was already nonsense when we met.

123
00:07:53.265 --> 00:07:55.475
It's even more strange to call it fate.

124
00:07:55.559 --> 00:07:57.019
"Fate" huh?

125
00:07:57.102 --> 00:07:59.730
I think it's best if we part ways now.

126
00:07:59.813 --> 00:08:00.689
I'm just free.

127
00:08:02.774 --> 00:08:03.984
Hey, I'd like to leave first.

128
00:08:09.323 --> 00:08:11.033
{\an8}(Part 4)

129
00:08:44.775 --> 00:08:47.194
Come on, don't you have an umbrella?

130
00:08:47.778 --> 00:08:49.446
Hell, it's not my problem.

131
00:09:03.669 --> 00:09:06.129
Damn it, you're all wet.

132
00:09:06.213 --> 00:09:08.257
That dress still looks new.

133
00:09:08.840 --> 00:09:12.177
Seriously, why don't you call a taxi?

134
00:09:19.393 --> 00:09:21.228
Yep, that's it.

135
00:09:21.311 --> 00:09:22.980
Go buy an umbrella.

136
00:09:26.775 --> 00:09:27.859
(Price 19,900 won)

137
00:09:39.871 --> 00:09:41.206
What? Don't you buy it?

138
00:09:41.290 --> 00:09:44.001
The price probably isn't that much, so just buy it!

139
00:09:49.047 --> 00:09:49.881
Thank you.

140
00:09:49.965 --> 00:09:53.051
Why are you running like that? who just had surgery

141
00:09:53.135 --> 00:09:54.594
In that situation, I definitely still had a stomach ache.

142
00:09:57.597 --> 00:09:59.766
Okay, I'll send it myself.

143
00:10:07.190 --> 00:10:08.358
Damn it.

144
00:10:54.321 --> 00:10:55.364
Have you come back yet?

145
00:10:57.574 --> 00:10:58.408
- Why?
- What?

146
00:10:58.492 --> 00:10:59.701
Do you trust your hand 100%?

147
00:10:59.785 --> 00:11:01.703
Take it easy, bro!

148
00:11:01.787 --> 00:11:04.247
I swear, I didn't know he was Pilgu!

149
00:11:04.748 --> 00:11:08.168
Exchanging pictures or phone numbers
His identity will be revealed on social media.

150
00:11:08.251 --> 00:11:10.879
Sunwoo says it will make him less excited before going on a date.

151
00:11:10.962 --> 00:11:13.048
I didn't know he was trying to conceal his identity.

152
00:11:28.563 --> 00:11:30.232
But how about the blind date?

153
00:11:30.732 --> 00:11:32.401
What do you think?

154
00:11:32.901 --> 00:11:35.028
You're dressed so beautifully.

155
00:11:35.112 --> 00:11:37.197
- Did Pilgu hyung have a crush on you from the first time you saw him?
- What do you say?

156
00:11:40.033 --> 00:11:42.035
It's been a while since this. I write good news. About him

157
00:11:42.119 --> 00:11:44.246
And my Pilgu hyung saved your life too.

158
00:11:44.329 --> 00:11:45.539
How did I ask?

159
00:11:47.165 --> 00:11:48.458
Wait, why is it so wet?

160
00:11:48.542 --> 00:11:50.669
Didn't my Pilgu hyung drive the car to drop you off even though it was raining?

161
00:11:52.337 --> 00:11:54.256
Why would he send me away?

162
00:11:56.883 --> 00:11:57.968
It's a pity.

163
00:11:58.760 --> 00:12:00.262
I should have been his sister-in-law.

164
00:12:00.345 --> 00:12:01.430
"Nong Mia"?

165
00:12:01.930 --> 00:12:02.764
Come here.

166
00:12:02.848 --> 00:12:04.850
My sister and the ghost! What the fuck?

167
00:12:04.933 --> 00:12:07.018
Stop hitting me! I just want to help!

168
00:12:09.563 --> 00:12:12.232
I didn't know that my friend's brother and sister already knew each other.

169
00:12:12.315 --> 00:12:13.442
You don't have to.

170
00:12:13.525 --> 00:12:15.110
Don't talk, don't talk about this.

171
00:12:15.193 --> 00:12:18.405
Tell me where you met your friend Hong Shin.

172
00:12:18.488 --> 00:12:21.032
- Why do you ask?
- I asked where you knew him.

173
00:12:22.492 --> 00:12:24.161
I already know the answer here.

174
00:12:24.744 --> 00:12:26.955
So you really want to be an actor?

175
00:12:28.039 --> 00:12:30.083
Have you lost your mind?

176
00:12:30.584 --> 00:12:33.211
I don't say anything So it doesn't look like I'm doing a favor.

177
00:12:33.295 --> 00:12:36.631
But I accepted a delivery job.
and work at the warehouse on weekends

178
00:12:36.715 --> 00:12:38.592
While working at a printing shop

179
00:12:38.675 --> 00:12:41.094
Because I'm afraid that my younger brother, who has a good head,
There will be no money to study medicine!

180
00:12:41.178 --> 00:12:42.804
I'm giving everything to you so you won't embarrass anyone!

181
00:12:42.888 --> 00:12:43.763
Do you know?

182
00:12:44.681 --> 00:12:45.682
Yes, I know.

183
00:12:47.434 --> 00:12:49.644
I know that you pay a lot for tutoring.
Even though our house is in poverty

184
00:12:50.145 --> 00:12:51.563
And you bought me something nice.

185
00:12:51.646 --> 00:12:53.440
I won't be ashamed of my friends.

186
00:12:53.523 --> 00:12:55.066
Because I'm doing my duty as a father.

187
00:12:55.775 --> 00:12:57.277
That's why I grew up without missing anything.

188
00:12:57.360 --> 00:12:58.653
You know all too well.

189
00:12:59.613 --> 00:13:02.616
But you still lied to me and mom.
Then I dropped out to study medicine.

190
00:13:03.366 --> 00:13:04.284
I'm sorry for lying to you.

191
00:13:04.367 --> 00:13:07.037
But I really want to be an actor.

192
00:13:08.622 --> 00:13:10.207
Am I making acting look easy for you?

193
00:13:10.290 --> 00:13:13.335
Do you know how many people are in celebrity families?
who tried to debut after gaining attention

194
00:13:13.418 --> 00:13:15.170
But then he failed and disappeared from view.

195
00:13:15.253 --> 00:13:17.047
I don't plan on relying on your merit at all!

196
00:13:17.130 --> 00:13:20.091
Moreover, our family relationships
Yes, when is it worth showing off?

197
00:13:22.010 --> 00:13:24.221
Having different fathers is not something to be proud of.

198
00:13:26.932 --> 00:13:27.891
Hey, you crazy kid!

199
00:13:29.684 --> 00:13:30.977
Im Sun Woo!

200
00:13:32.270 --> 00:13:33.647
Eat deliciously!

201
00:13:33.730 --> 00:13:35.232
(Sports Eun Sung)

202
00:13:39.152 --> 00:13:40.278
Don't you eat lunch?

203
00:13:41.238 --> 00:13:42.072
Today I want to pass.

204
00:13:42.155 --> 00:13:43.114
Yes.

205
00:13:44.866 --> 00:13:45.784
Please wait!

206
00:15:15.540 --> 00:15:16.458
Hey, bro.

207
00:15:16.541 --> 00:15:19.002
That American agency contacted me.

208
00:15:20.337 --> 00:15:23.340
They work very slowly.
Until I haven't read my email yet.

209
00:15:23.840 --> 00:15:26.593
All big companies are like this.

210
00:15:26.676 --> 00:15:27.969
Oh, that's true.

211
00:15:28.053 --> 00:15:30.138
Have you read the news that reporter V Jung Shin wrote?

212
00:15:30.221 --> 00:15:32.515
All the news related to the rumors about me having a girlfriend in the past.

213
00:15:32.599 --> 00:15:35.644
and your rude travel behavior
It's all been erased.

214
00:15:35.727 --> 00:15:36.561
Really?

215
00:15:36.645 --> 00:15:38.104
That reporter...

216
00:15:38.188 --> 00:15:40.023
Now the news she wrote seemed strange.

217
00:15:40.607 --> 00:15:45.236
She connected my character to the real me.

218
00:15:45.320 --> 00:15:48.365
and write news with dimensions

219
00:15:48.990 --> 00:15:51.284
I think we should treat her to a meal.

220
00:15:51.368 --> 00:15:52.661
Don't be delusional.

221
00:16:02.379 --> 00:16:04.547
The world is really round.

222
00:16:04.631 --> 00:16:07.008
- What? Why?
- There's nothing.

223
00:16:07.092 --> 00:16:11.096
Anyway
There are a lot of advertising companies calling us!

224
00:16:11.179 --> 00:16:12.097
Damn it.

225
00:16:12.889 --> 00:16:14.599
At first she tried to bury me. Later he helped me.

226
00:16:14.683 --> 00:16:17.310
She's really good at patting the head and patting the back.

227
00:16:17.894 --> 00:16:20.647
- If you have time, go feed her.
- All right.

228
00:16:21.231 --> 00:16:23.274
But, bro

229
00:16:23.358 --> 00:16:26.277
Today there will be many journalists coming to the Ramyeon promotion event.

230
00:16:26.361 --> 00:16:29.406
You're not going to dismiss reporter V Jung Shin from his job, are you?

231
00:16:30.365 --> 00:16:32.534
Hey, I'm not an unreasonable person.

232
00:16:34.577 --> 00:16:36.663
Why are you still wearing clothes and not going to get a massage?

233
00:16:38.123 --> 00:16:40.333
Oh, right now I'm in bad shape.

234
00:16:41.042 --> 00:16:42.085
I'm too embarrassed.

235
00:16:46.172 --> 00:16:47.048
Hello

236
00:16:53.596 --> 00:16:55.432
I've lost all my hair.

237
00:17:00.019 --> 00:17:01.062
Hey, what?

238
00:17:01.855 --> 00:17:03.398
Director Shin Kwang Soo, why?

239
00:17:05.024 --> 00:17:07.152
He's extremely anti-social.

240
00:17:07.235 --> 00:17:08.903
I worked with him when I was a freshman.

241
00:17:08.987 --> 00:17:12.031
This person teaches us.
What is it like to hurt each other with words?

242
00:17:12.115 --> 00:17:14.325
And what about director Cha Dong Man?

243
00:17:14.409 --> 00:17:16.911
- The person who directed the story "The Villain's Equation"
- Yeah.

244
00:17:16.995 --> 00:17:19.414
Haven't seen that yet?
Very sloppy directing!

245
00:17:20.206 --> 00:17:21.916
So who will you work with?

246
00:17:22.000 --> 00:17:24.043
We have to prepare for filming now!

247
00:17:24.127 --> 00:17:26.755
Don't get emotional. I'll ask about wrinkles.

248
00:17:26.838 --> 00:17:29.424
Wrinkles are not a problem now!

249
00:17:29.507 --> 00:17:31.760
The TV station will think I'm raising sheep!

250
00:17:31.843 --> 00:17:34.471
Hey, take it easy.

251
00:17:34.554 --> 00:17:37.265
Seniors, right now there is news that is very well written. About seniors

252
00:17:37.348 --> 00:17:39.142
We should release the schedule.

253
00:17:39.225 --> 00:17:40.894
When the senior's image was at its best

254
00:17:43.897 --> 00:17:45.648
I'd like to end it here.

255
00:17:58.411 --> 00:18:00.413
I agree that this is well-written news.

256
00:18:02.373 --> 00:18:03.249
Really.

257
00:18:03.333 --> 00:18:04.626
("Good Detective" Im Hyun Joon
Aura surges off-screen because of good deeds)

258
00:18:04.709 --> 00:18:06.795
(Sports Eun Sung
Wi Jungshin)

259
00:18:08.379 --> 00:18:09.255
What?

260
00:18:10.173 --> 00:18:12.425
Was she a political reporter?

261
00:18:12.926 --> 00:18:14.511
([Special report]
