00:50:38.119 --> 00:50:39.746
Instead of empathizing with others

774
00:50:39.829 --> 00:50:43.124
It's probably best to do it for your own benefit.

775
00:50:43.833 --> 00:50:46.544
One more thing, do you have pain in your lower back?

776
00:50:46.627 --> 00:50:48.796
Yes, how do you know?

777
00:50:48.880 --> 00:50:53.092
People who pick up the Ten of Swords often have back pain in the waist area.

778
00:50:53.176 --> 00:50:56.429
Oh wow, it's like you're a clairvoyant shaman!

779
00:50:56.512 --> 00:50:57.513
I'm not a witch doctor.

780
00:50:58.556 --> 00:51:00.933
Anyway, the cards tell me.

781
00:51:01.017 --> 00:51:04.729
These chaotic situations will continue for a while.

782
00:51:08.775 --> 00:51:10.693
I have another thing I want to ask you.

783
00:51:10.777 --> 00:51:13.988
Lately, the work I'm doing is going very well.

784
00:51:14.071 --> 00:51:16.491
But to be honest
I want to try something different.

785
00:51:16.574 --> 00:51:19.368
It seems like my current job isn't helping me grow.

786
00:51:19.452 --> 00:51:21.996
And I feel like I'm complacent.

787
00:51:24.499 --> 00:51:25.583
you think

788
00:51:26.959 --> 00:51:30.004
Can I start something new?

789
00:51:30.588 --> 00:51:32.965
Now I think the best

790
00:51:33.049 --> 00:51:36.052
That is, you keep doing what you're doing.
Instead of trying new things.

791
00:51:36.135 --> 00:51:37.553
Don't let greed take over.

792
00:51:37.637 --> 00:51:39.222
The cards told me

793
00:51:39.305 --> 00:51:42.099
If you succeed in doing what you are doing now,

794
00:51:42.183 --> 00:51:43.893
It will lead to better opportunities.

795
00:51:44.435 --> 00:51:46.938
What are you going to know?

796
00:51:55.905 --> 00:51:57.865
Let's meet at Roseanne Cafe at 8:00 AM.

797
00:51:57.949 --> 00:51:59.200
Rosanne Café at 8 o'clock?

798
00:52:01.828 --> 00:52:04.914
- You really don't want to act in that movie?
- I told you no!

799
00:52:04.997 --> 00:52:06.499
- Just because Zena played?
- I don't play!

800
00:52:06.582 --> 00:52:08.084
Then you have to keep playing Kang Pilgu.

801
00:52:08.167 --> 00:52:10.336
What are you playing around with? Haven't found a new director yet.

802
00:52:11.337 --> 00:52:12.797
I'll say it.

803
00:52:12.880 --> 00:52:15.174
We'd better go meet the director first.

804
00:52:15.258 --> 00:52:16.300
Which director?

805
00:52:16.384 --> 00:52:19.303
If I tell you, the first thing you'll do is deny it!

806
00:52:19.387 --> 00:52:22.014
Just go meet and talk to the director first, okay?

807
00:52:22.098 --> 00:52:25.101
I'd be crazy to be the mediator!

808
00:52:25.184 --> 00:52:26.394
Crazy!

809
00:52:26.477 --> 00:52:29.313
You always bring me here when you need something from me.

810
00:52:31.983 --> 00:52:33.401
Don't let greed take over.

811
00:52:33.484 --> 00:52:36.028
“Right now I think it's the best.

812
00:52:36.112 --> 00:52:39.031
That is, you keep doing what you're doing.
Instead of trying new things."

813
00:52:39.115 --> 00:52:40.575
The card says so.

814
00:52:40.658 --> 00:52:43.661
I intend not to play. No matter what

815
00:52:45.580 --> 00:52:46.789
But I will play for you.

816
00:52:47.373 --> 00:52:49.500
OK, fine, let's do it for now and…

817
00:52:50.459 --> 00:52:51.669
What do you say?

818
00:52:51.752 --> 00:52:53.796
Are you going to play?

819
00:52:53.880 --> 00:52:54.964
I told you how to play.

820
00:52:55.047 --> 00:52:56.507
Is it true?

821
00:52:57.008 --> 00:52:59.260
Wait, let me record the sound first.

822
00:52:59.343 --> 00:53:00.219
I'm compressing it.

823
00:53:00.303 --> 00:53:01.596
- Go ahead!
- What do you say?

824
00:53:01.679 --> 00:53:04.557
- Come on!
- Look, I pressed the record button.

825
00:53:04.640 --> 00:53:06.684
I'm really going to play Kang Pilgu.

826
00:53:06.767 --> 00:53:09.562
I, Im Hyun Joon, vow to play.

827
00:53:09.645 --> 00:53:12.440
Kang Pilgu season five No matter what!

828
00:53:12.523 --> 00:53:14.275
okay!

829
00:53:18.571 --> 00:53:19.447
Are you satisfied yet?

830
00:53:35.421 --> 00:53:38.591
(Rosan Cafe)

831
00:53:48.017 --> 00:53:48.935
Is she Pan Soo Jung?

832
00:53:49.518 --> 00:53:50.561
How do you know me?

833
00:53:51.103 --> 00:53:52.939
Thank you for coming.

834
00:53:53.022 --> 00:53:55.608
So what made you contact me?

835
00:53:56.442 --> 00:53:59.278
You seem like someone who keeps promises.

836
00:54:00.529 --> 00:54:01.572
Call this number.

837
00:54:01.656 --> 00:54:04.784
Her 12-year-old sister is bedridden.
because of rare disease

838
00:54:05.368 --> 00:54:07.453
There must be a way for her to take care of her younger sibling.

839
00:54:07.536 --> 00:54:09.288
without working here

840
00:54:12.458 --> 00:54:13.542
It's because of you.

841
00:54:13.626 --> 00:54:16.379
My sister is currently receiving treatment.

842
00:54:16.462 --> 00:54:18.714
- Don't you work there anymore?
- Yes.

843
00:54:19.882 --> 00:54:22.134
But why do you want to meet me?

844
00:54:25.262 --> 00:54:26.806
I'm too scared

845
00:54:27.682 --> 00:54:29.308
To keep this matter to myself.

846
00:54:31.811 --> 00:54:34.063
Regarding that video I sent you…

847
00:54:34.647 --> 00:54:37.525
The script is still the same and hasn't changed.

848
00:54:37.608 --> 00:54:39.735
Writer Park is truly impressive.

849
00:54:39.819 --> 00:54:42.113
- This place has a really sharp twist.
- So?

850
00:54:42.196 --> 00:54:44.031
Where the good detective Kang Pilgu

851
00:54:44.115 --> 00:54:46.784
- Became a dishonest person.
- That's right.

852
00:54:46.867 --> 00:54:51.455
You have no idea how grateful we are.
That you made this decision

853
00:54:52.039 --> 00:54:54.500
Seriously, you saved all of our lives!

854
00:54:54.583 --> 00:54:56.794
Who will take the love role?
Or what about a rom-com for him to play at this age?

855
00:54:56.877 --> 00:54:58.754
He can only play the role of Kang Pil Goo.

856
00:55:03.509 --> 00:55:04.927
That's it.

857
00:55:06.679 --> 00:55:07.805
I should thank you

858
00:55:07.888 --> 00:55:09.265
Not at all!

859
00:55:11.308 --> 00:55:13.352
By the way, isn't the director coming?

860
00:55:14.645 --> 00:55:15.980
Screenwriter Park hasn't arrived yet either.

861
00:55:18.024 --> 00:55:20.609
Oh, they will come together.

862
00:55:20.693 --> 00:55:21.736
- Yes.
- Yeah.

863
00:55:21.819 --> 00:55:23.821
- Come together?
- Yes.

864
00:55:23.904 --> 00:55:26.490
If you really want to know who it is, hurry up and tell me.

865
00:55:26.574 --> 00:55:27.950
Damn it.

866
00:55:28.034 --> 00:55:29.952
Come on, CEO Hwang.

867
00:55:30.036 --> 00:55:30.870
Hello!

868
00:55:30.953 --> 00:55:32.038
Hey

869
00:55:32.621 --> 00:55:34.331
- Come in.
- Hey, Screenwriter Park.

870
00:55:35.458 --> 00:55:38.210
Where is the director? I thought we'd come together.

871
00:55:40.337 --> 00:55:41.839
Haven't you told him yet?

872
00:55:44.175 --> 00:55:45.468
What did you say?

873
00:55:48.637 --> 00:55:51.140
What happened? Why did the atmosphere suddenly change?

874
00:56:01.067 --> 00:56:02.193
Or will it be…

875
00:56:09.283 --> 00:56:10.785
Don't tell me he...

876
00:56:14.163 --> 00:56:15.164
Please tell me I'm wrong.

877
00:56:15.247 --> 00:56:16.332
Screenwriter Park said he would do it himself.

878
00:56:19.376 --> 00:56:20.419
Will he do it himself?

879
00:56:21.879 --> 00:56:22.755
What are you doing?

880
00:56:26.926 --> 00:56:27.760
Directed

881
00:56:28.344 --> 00:56:30.429
For Kang Pilgu this season

882
00:56:30.513 --> 00:56:32.890
We decided to give the screenwriter Park
Both wrote the script and directed it.

883
00:56:40.356 --> 00:56:41.482
Mr…

884
00:56:44.693 --> 00:56:45.903
Are you going to direct it yourself?

885
00:56:47.696 --> 00:56:49.073
I'll do my best, sunbae!

886
00:56:49.698 --> 00:56:50.658
Hurry and take it.

887
00:56:50.741 --> 00:56:51.742
Hurry and get it.

888
00:56:52.326 --> 00:56:53.994
Cut again.

889
00:56:54.078 --> 00:56:54.912
Cut!

890
00:56:54.995 --> 00:56:56.622
Ready for action!

891
00:56:56.705 --> 00:56:59.250
Cut ready for action!

892
00:57:00.918 --> 00:57:02.044
Cut! Don't stop.

893
00:57:02.128 --> 00:57:03.879
Continue showing until I order a cut.

894
00:57:03.963 --> 00:57:06.173
The seniors seemed completely unprepared for their characters.

895
00:57:06.257 --> 00:57:08.634
Today we will stop filming and go fix it later.

896
00:57:08.717 --> 00:57:11.637
Yes, when have seniors ever worked with those directors?

897
00:57:11.720 --> 00:57:13.013
Action!

898
00:57:13.097 --> 00:57:16.308
If I had known that my seniors' acting was this bad,
I probably wouldn't bother my seniors to come play.

899
00:57:16.892 --> 00:57:17.935
Hope…

900
00:57:18.018 --> 00:57:21.814
We won't meet each other again. Damn boy!

901
00:58:01.770 --> 00:58:04.315
Regarding that video I sent you…

902
00:58:05.316 --> 00:58:08.068
There is another person who is not in the video.

903
00:58:17.036 --> 00:58:19.330
Who is very famous?

904
00:58:27.880 --> 00:58:28.714
Quanzena

905
00:59:47.876 --> 00:59:50.129
{\an8}(Thank you Oh Yeon Seo
who came as a guest actor)

906
00:59:53.299 --> 00:59:54.717
{\an8}Is this the first time you've been to a baseball stadium?

907
00:59:54.800 --> 00:59:57.636
{\an8}- Let's watch together after the interview is finished.
- Yes.

908
00:59:58.220 --> 01:00:01.974
{\an8}How can I write news if you always keep your answers short?

909
01:00:02.516 --> 01:00:04.226
{\an8}I'm going to meet reporter V Jung Shin. Shall we go together?

910
01:00:04.310 --> 01:00:06.979
{\an8}Today filming will be finished before 6 p.m., right?

911
01:00:07.062 --> 01:00:08.480
{\an8}- It's already six o'clock.
- It's already six o'clock?

912
01:00:09.523 --> 01:00:11.025
{\an8}How far? How much longer?

913
01:00:11.108 --> 01:00:12.693
{\an8}Let's hurry up, okay?

914
01:00:13.485 --> 01:00:14.320
{\an8}I haven't seen you in a long time.

915
01:00:14.903 --> 01:00:16.113
{\an8}I know where we can go.

916
01:00:16.196 --> 01:00:18.615
{\an8}It's dark and private.

917
01:00:19.283 --> 01:00:21.035
{\an8}that…

918
01:00:24.830 --> 01:00:26.832
{\an8}Narration by Chalanthon Ruangpakdee

